criteria:
Inclusion criteria:
a) Age ≥ 18 years;
b) Radiologically confirmed fragility fracture of the pelvic ring;
c) Surgical treatment performed;
d) Fixation methods included:
- Fixation using two short sacroiliac screws;
- Fixation using four short sacroiliac screws;
- Lumbopelvic fixation;
e)  Availability of complete inpatient medical records and preoperative imaging data;
f)  Completion of at least one postoperative follow-up examination.
Exclusion criteria:
a) Pathological fracture associated with a malignant disease;
b) Fracture resulting from high-energy trauma;
c) Active infection;
d) History of previous pelvic reconstructive surgery;
e) Missing essential clinical data.
